# Normalise line endings to LF in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# Not cosmetic: this repo is built and run in Linux containers. A CRLF Makefile
# breaks make, a CRLF shell script fails with "bad interpreter", and the
# generated-file drift checks would report spurious diffs when a container
# writes LF into a file git checked out as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
